# THE TRIGGER, which this card never drove although the mesh has always had it. The
# surface is called `hidden2` in this set's export and `trigger` in Vanilla's -- the same
# geometry under a name that says nothing -- so it was found by matching 44 verts, centroid 0.00 apart
# against Vanilla's, not by reading the name. The hinge is Vanilla's measurement for this
# mesh, unchanged.
part trigger
  role    = trigger
  surface = hidden2
  dof
    kind    = hinge
    axis    = 0, 1, 0
    degrees = 19.93
    pivot   = -21.740, 0, -2.936
  end
end
